import{_ as o,o as n,c as i,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 418 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eradicate Cultivation Predation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 418 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eradicate Cultivation Predation","no":418,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Alaya Network","Supervision Plan","Eradicate Predation","Institutional Design"],"related":["21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0418_模块2-莽荒纪-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝修仙掠夺的制度设计.md","filePath":"en/0418_模块2-莽荒纪-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝修仙掠夺的制度设计.md"}'),a={name:"en/0418_模块2-莽荒纪-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝修仙掠夺的制度设计.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-418-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-eradicate-cultivation-predation" tabindex="-1">Entry 418 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eradicate Cultivation Predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-418-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-eradicate-cultivation-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 418 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eradicate Cultivation Predation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 23) | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 27, 49</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-cultivation-world-s-biggest-loophole-is-the-absence-of-a-recorder" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the cultivation world&#39;s biggest loophole is the absence of a &quot;recorder&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-cultivation-world-s-biggest-loophole-is-the-absence-of-a-recorder" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the cultivation world&#39;s biggest loophole is the absence of a &quot;recorder&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The six top-level axioms take the anti-predation axiom as bottom line and the causal self-discipline axiom as supplement. One root cause why predation runs rampant in Manghuang&#39;s cultivation world is <strong>the absence of whole-network recording and supervision</strong> — who devoured how many resources, who killed how many beings, who occupied how many spiritual veins, all decided by fists; no one records, no one holds accountable. This entry prescribes medicine: using Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, install on Manghuang&#39;s cultivation world a &quot;recorder + monitoring net.&quot; The law-first axiom is core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: before installation = high-leaning-medium, after = extremely low. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In a cultivation world without records, energy waste goes unaccounted: how much resource Ji Ning devoured, how much energy Great-Expert battles wasted, all are muddled accounts. After installing Alaya, every flow of energy is recorded, metered, recovered — <strong>waste is waste first of all because no one keeps the books.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In a cultivation world without supervision, regression goes uncorrected:</p><ol><li><strong>Predation undiscovered</strong>: strong ones seize resources, kill beings; no network record</li><li><strong>Errors uncorrected</strong>: whoever took a wrong road; no whole-network comparison</li><li><strong>Experience unsedimented</strong>: Dao-comprehension goes with the person, because no one records</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How Alaya supervision dismantles predation&#39;s &quot;anonymity&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Predation traceable</strong>: who occupied spiritual veins, who refined fierce beasts; whole-network searchable; cannot whitewash with &quot;ownerless goods&quot;</li><li><strong>Strong ones pre-warned</strong>: top cultivators&#39; abnormal devouring, Alaya pre-warns; Anchor Inspection Committee intervenes</li><li><strong>Breakthrough auditable</strong>: any &quot;plot-tier breakthrough&quot; must pass self-consistency check; no one enjoys rule exception</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang No-Supervision Loophole</th><th>Alaya Supervision Design</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Predation unrecorded</td><td>Alaya whole-network record; every resource flow traceable</td></tr><tr><td>Strong-one anomaly un-warned</td><td>Anchor Inspection Committee: abnormal devouring = warning + intervention</td></tr><tr><td>Breakthrough conditions vague</td><td>Breakthrough audit: any leap must pass self-consistency check</td></tr><tr><td>Dao-comprehension goes with the person</td><td>Lifetime Dao-comprehension real-time recorded; passing does not bury</td></tr><tr><td>Strong one defines resources</td><td>Symbiotic Court adjudicates; resource ownership not by fists</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: install Alaya Network on Manghuang&#39;s world; cover resources, cultivation, breakthrough three domains</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;no supervision,&quot; &quot;record only,&quot; &quot;record + warning + audit&quot; three supervision intensities</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: predation incident rate, resource waste rate, lineage-inheritance rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — after three-layer supervision fully on, predation incident rate drops to under one-tenth of the no-supervision model; lineage-inheritance rate rises by an order of magnitude</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Before installation setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. No records means rules cannot be externally verified</li><li><strong>After installation setting self-consistency: high</strong>. All rules auditable, traceable</li><li><strong>After installation retcon-ending risk: extremely low</strong>. Recording makes retconning impossible to hide</li><li><strong>After installation protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely low</strong>. Supervision network does not depend on any individual</li></ul><p>Alaya supervision is not to monitor to the point of suffocation, but to turn invisible predation into visible accounts. Manghuang&#39;s world&#39;s biggest problem is muddled accounts — who devoured how much, who occupied how much, all by conscience. Once every item is on the network, however strong a strong one dares not drain a spiritual vein, because the whole network is watching. Supervision&#39;s purpose is not punishment, but to turn predation from anonymous to real-name. When predators cannot pretend it is ownerless goods, rules&#39; teeth truly grow in.</p><p>Alaya supervision also has a benefit: it makes rules learnable. Manghuang&#39;s rules are only in strong ones&#39; brains; outsiders cannot learn; Alaya makes rules public; anyone can search, learn, compare themselves. Public rules are rules; rules hidden in strong ones&#39; brains are only unwritten rules.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: first keep the books, then recover; waste has nowhere to hide</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: predation traceable, strong ones pre-warned, breakthrough auditable</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s Peerless Academy is an offline school; Alaya is a whole-network supervision net</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks equal in whole-network record; predators nowhere to hide</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: whole-network naturally cross-plane; expansion does not break supervision</li></ul><p>Alaya supervision also has an ethical premise: it supervises strong ones, not mortals. In Manghuang&#39;s world mortals have little to devour or seize anyway; who truly needs supervision are top cultivators. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s supervision net specifically watches energy-anomalous beings; the stronger the more watched — this is the complete opposite of the old world where &quot;strong = privilege.&quot; Supervision is not distrust, but strong ones&#39; energy is inherently large; large energy must be matched with large supervision.</p><p>The highest state of supervision is making the supervised self-disciplined. Manghuang maintains order by fists; Heng Yuan Zhou uses the network to internalize rules. When every cultivator knows his every move is whole-network searchable, self-discipline replaces heteronomy.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cultivation world&#39;s biggest loophole is not strong ones too strong, but no one keeps the books. Alaya supervision&#39;s meaning is to make every predation leave traces, make every breakthrough auditable. When predation is no longer anonymous, however strong a strong one can only walk the straight road — this is institutions&#39; true domestication of power.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · Alaya supervision plan · institutional design to eradicate cultivation predation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./417_模块2-莽荒纪-制度替代收益-锚点共生注入莽荒世界.html">Entry 417 · Institutional-Alternative Gains</a> · <a href="./419_模块2-莽荒纪-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与种族歧视.html">Entry 419 · Myriad-Races Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=o(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
